# trader: the saved game the overpay session (DOS's golden) starts from. A new character, as
# the newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): 40 rubies (0xA2, value 25 each) into the pack,
# and the player moved to level 2, (13,28), in the corridor beside the dwarf Brawnclan (whoami
# 88, at (12,28), who trades); Shift+A twice to face west, at him. Saved in slot I, described
# "trade". The rubies' value, 25 * 40 * quality 40, passes 7FFFh (assess_value, BARTER.C)
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0xA2 26
44100 cheat goto 2 13 28
47000 down shift       # Shift+A twice: face west
47050 key a
47100 up shift
48000 down shift
48050 key a
48100 up shift
50000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "trade"
50100 key s
50300 up ctrl
52000 key enter
53500 key t
53700 key r
53900 key a
54100 key d
54300 key e
55200 key enter
